    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (+1), Rare (+2), or Very Rare (+3)</em></p><p>While wearing these wraps, you have a bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls made with your Unarmed Strikes. The bonus is determined by the wraps’ rarity, and those strikes deal your choice of Force damage or their normal damage type.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Q2JYz5R95YTaZgxx\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Wrap Unarmed Strike</strong> activity can be used to enchant your Unarmed Strike with the relevant bonuses, rarity, and damage type. You will be able to select the damage type when you roll damage and the system will remember your choice going forward.</p><p>If you don't already have an Unarmed Strike natural weapon you can add this one to your character sheet: @UUID[Compendium.dnd-dungeon-masters-guide.equipment.Item.dmgUnarmedStrike]{Unarmed Strike}.</p></section><p> @Embed[Compendium.dnd-dungeon-masters-guide.content.JournalEntry.dmgFoundryRefere.JournalEntryPage.Ok4iCgD25ENgoRxE cite=false caption=false classes=\"hide-in-embed\"]</p>",
